{"attack":"我方全员进行攻击。同行的宝可梦越多，招式的攻击次数越多。","description":"攻击目标造成伤害，没有异常状态或濒死的全部同行宝可梦都会攻击对手。招式的威力会根据同行宝可梦的攻击种族值变化。\n\n每一击的威力\u003d使用方的一只同行宝可梦的攻击种族值⁄10 + 5。\n使用方的每一只同行宝可梦都会参与计算1次攻击的威力。\n每一击击中要害的概率都相等。\n如果某一下触发了目标的气势披带、气势头带、结实特性或打破了替身，招式会继续攻击。\n忍耐、金属爆炸和双倍奉还只计算最后一次的伤害。\n如果使用者持有王者之证或锐利之牙，或具有恶臭特性，每一下攻击都有相同的概率造成对手畏缩。\n如果目标拥有咒术之躯、碎裂铠甲特性，每一下攻击都会触发效果。即使特性发动令攻击方陷入一些可能无法行动的状态（如麻痹、畏缩、着迷、定身法状态），也不会影响本次攻击，但陷入睡眠和濒死时攻击即刻停止。\n目标的变色特性在最后一下攻击完成后才发动。\n狙击手特性无效。","levelUpMoves":[{"Name":"Sneasel","Level":42},{"Name":"Houndour","Level":25},{"Name":"Houndoom","Level":26},{"Name":"Weavile","Level":0},{"Name":"Scraggy","Level":24},{"Name":"Scrafty","Level":24},{"Name":"Durant","Level":12},{"Name":"Wishiwashi form:solo","Level":8},{"Name":"Wishiwashi form:school","Level":8},{"Name":"Passimian","Level":15},{"Name":"Nickit","Level":4},{"Name":"Thievul","Level":0},{"Name":"Tandemaus","Level":37},{"Name":"Maushold form:family_four","Level":41},{"Name":"Maushold form:family_three","Level":41},{"Name":"Fezandipiti","Level":48}],"tutorMoves":[],"eggMoves":["Nidorina","Nidoqueen","Nidorino","Nidoking","Mankey","Primeape","Aipom","Girafarig","Shiftry","Ambipom","Cottonee","Whimsicott","Bramblin","Brambleghast","Annihilape","Farigiraf"],"trMoves":[],"hmMoves":[],"transferMoves":["Ekans","Arbok","Aipom","Houndour","Houndoom","Shiftry","Ambipom","Cottonee","Whimsicott"],"tmMoves9":[],"tmMoves8":["Charmander","Charmeleon","Charizard","Nidoranfemale","Nidorina","Nidoqueen","Nidoranmale","Nidorino","Nidoking","Diglett","Diglett form:alolan","Dugtrio","Dugtrio form:alolan","Persian form:alolan","Kangaskhan","Mew","Sneasel","Seedot","Nuzleaf","Shiftry","Vespiquen","Weavile","Cottonee","Whimsicott","Sandile","Krokorok","Krookodile","Scraggy","Scrafty","Vanilluxe","Pawniard","Bisharp","Durant","Zweilous","Hydreigon","Pangoro","Binacle","Barbaracle","Wishiwashi form:solo","Wishiwashi form:school","Salandit","Salazzle","Passimian","Mimikyu form:disguised","Nickit","Thievul","Falinks","Drakloak","Dragapult","Urshifu 